    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "You just got out of prison, serving time for a crime that you did not commit, and on top of that you have had debts that have been accruing this whole time. Now it's time to take to the ever-changing streets to acquire gold, and take on bounties to take out rival crime bosses.<br><br><strong>Dexterous: Time to Steal</strong> plays like a combination of Candy Crush and Slay the Spire. Loot powerful offensive and defensive blocks that will help you survive the streets. Match 3 blocks of the same color to use the abilities they contain. When deadly foes defeat you, a mysterious force pulls you back in time to try again, and again... and again.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Collect and upgrade blocks to increase your power and help defeat foes and rival crime bosses.<br></li><li>Gather game-changing relics that will make every run unique.<br></li><li>Take resources you find back to your hideout to unlock permanent upgrades.<br></li><li>Explore the ever-changing streets, ensuring a new run every time.<br></li><li>Unlock new difficulties with each successful run.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "You just got out of prison, serving time for a crime that you did not commit, and on top of that you have had debts that have been accruing this whole time. Now it's time to take to the ever-changing streets to acquire gold, and take on bounties to take out rival crime bosses.<br><br><strong>Dexterous: Time to Steal</strong> plays like a combination of Candy Crush and Slay the Spire. Loot powerful offensive and defensive blocks that will help you survive the streets. Match 3 blocks of the same color to use the abilities they contain. When deadly foes defeat you, a mysterious force pulls you back in time to try again, and again... and again.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Collect and upgrade blocks to increase your power and help defeat foes and rival crime bosses.<br></li><li>Gather game-changing relics that will make every run unique.<br></li><li>Take resources you find back to your hideout to unlock permanent upgrades.<br></li><li>Explore the ever-changing streets, ensuring a new run every time.<br></li><li>Unlock new difficulties with each successful run.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A Match-3 Roguelite where you build your deck of blocks, collect game-changing relics, and battle your way through crime bosses in an attempt to pay off your debt and escape the time loop.",
